  "actual_voice_rows": [
    {
      "file": "voice_00.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c280dd53a03899ba5bf383ae5b9e623577d0b7e86936da66bc58fa57d8a2d499",
      "words_sha256": "00e0b64653a58aca5d506f7a318dc2e3d88284fa43f4f4b8fb3c881b7b0e5584",
      "request_id": "d9fd7379db856a3eeb7e4d584d49b41a2445d4f41b5284b3108de8ed98dca5b5",
      "request_text": "温网第一轮，谢尔顿拿到赛点，最后却输掉了比赛。两个多月后，他第一次站上大满贯决赛的球场。"
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "079ddb5ed69054e4f588015dca7341f4b8a911a2f45284bb32ae9bebe40dff5d",
      "words_sha256": "fd8155dc59db567689cf3daee28ede46bce93cc26303e9c74a9242deeb436604",
      "request_id": "8588f839671a7449712da6bf395f62813950b3deb0b0670781bb1b5c2b0e19e2",
      "request_text": "先从澳网说起。打进8强之后，他三盘输给辛纳。"
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_03.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c3bf0fb79043446d76894f4ba4310b116c3fd6fbefb2c8ad50689f6bd3858bc3",
      "words_sha256": "af52fd9bf047f8ab0c68897a7d7d3313e00e07a8c6ebd7b664126051efb9a0b0",
      "request_id": "1dad5b79b639856b1e7e95578237e8995a9d2b2862222a7d7856a745069c3f39",
      "request_text": "二月达拉斯，面对弗里茨，他在决胜盘救回三个冠军点，最后逆转夺冠。"
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_05.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "ca1410edf528464e32a9c7c75e1bea647a5f1a1e2b450efc23cd0372c9c954ed",
      "words_sha256": "6a479a3dfb38bca85668d033151072bc23595eb188f18199bd2d28cf1addd66a",
      "request_id": "5d28abe81edfb1f825351f28225e40992ac3b32da93482d1029ebf88bd55f39e",
      "request_text": "四月慕尼黑，两盘击败科博利，赛季第二冠到手。这一回，他在红土上举起奖杯。"
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_07.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "822a6ca1dc6d59e1a7a4f9785b5df8ca7826112cb82d34d6e5bd7714bf8d29a8",
      "words_sha256": "0bcb2961931e7cd792348f24092946078fb62692e4da0c44e273ceffe6e76c77",
      "request_id": "6f1396e11152c839721e6caf3e42bc062030a7c15beed8199b90c7de0dd56791",
      "request_text": "可到了法网，他却在第二轮三盘输给科利尼翁。红土冠军，没有变成大满贯突破。"
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_08.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c67c1a6dcddf7660ad48c890cf09fbc54229264b93055b445cf47a155c58f313",
      "words_sha256": "d7f0ac9056dae47660acdd2cc79cacfbf944dca61bb29a447ba0d810e2794df3",
      "request_id": "bbb9abe520901d57acab8a10f0c7ca0673a2a48d330b3e73ec70a05c545d835f",
      "request_text": "转上草地，斯图加特决赛又遇弗里茨。他三盘赢球，拿到生涯第一座草地冠军。"
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d44743ab81748028f5f2e6728eb552ccf51d97d36242a888a065e290d3f8f25b",
      "words_sha256": "d9874dd437cbf5f7116621f9d2739ec8be7f86432a71799192f9d5d5fc387c4d",
      "request_id": "b6ed6c850367b8715719584d8bfab5a2b5adb84702b75f6572a45244bd78902a",
      "request_text": "半个月后的温网，决胜盘最后的抢十，他曾以八比五领先，还拿到一个赛点，最终却在第一轮出局。"
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b7b3bd17618e1df9379ccf56234defefdcaab6d7eb6726cbc4605857466a0d0a",
      "words_sha256": "eef59795e6c2ea6e2692a3f0caf9ce5b7223de8e787c9a6d91d86b2e0ed378df",
      "request_id": "86aea89485d44329c31e403718c56a899aa22f7715a13808d6b50ecb91980f5b",
      "request_text": "八月，加拿大大师赛。他六场比赛一盘未失，两盘击败中岛布兰登，成功卫冕。"
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_12.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "734d23f73e8c8287e2147b3f1e6491b527317cc88f2e813574015fdb110e619d",
      "words_sha256": "cb06a77fd1471b1c8011912c5bca393945734b7239d9c577376e4bd9509e8011",
      "request_id": "cb1a2ae99af4294b5e7ed202686b1284554919b9c1bd1d58128e49513f75922e",
      "request_text": "美网，他第一次击败阿尔卡拉斯，又逆转蒂亚福，第一次打进大满贯决赛。"
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_13.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "0d9e080700b83599d886615370f19a277172ddaa5ba355efdedfcd93a18afa6d",
      "words_sha256": "1df17c35ca43669b25d3aab2e0aa12f22d2d989330e957d1a999a01f00f763da",
      "request_id": "23935a43ed121de905e2e1e106270b1bd13951805d9ca31a20c38506a2cff6bf",
      "request_text": "决赛对兹维列夫，他四盘落败，收获亚军。从温网首轮到纽约决赛，他走出了完全不同的一段路。"
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_15.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d2b12d2e72a1bda1aca63994635036936c6b88cc3ce5bebc13edf5392bd7afa4",
      "words_sha256": "373acb43f6d2ce8106c011b39b46762032e07582660a19c67f7b4bc44b2ec408",
      "request_id": "65e9d340da27d6cd9f1df6b4c54443d436f2d6fcdc748fec67111a2dc969631e",
      "request_text": "亚洲赛季，上海止步第三轮。十月十八日，另一场比赛替他锁定了年终席位。"
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_16.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "6ecc1c530f604431abcbb513564b649103b91489f7677eacbcad9d9d4fc1a8fd",
      "words_sha256": "5fb93e072a77bef862f42229de017fcba32ea1952cbbdadcd3d9e2b9fba97018",
      "request_id": "29bf7848a24237c030f4ee45d5f36c63db59e5d0a83914c6fa789350d9a42a4e",
      "request_text": "达维多维奇·福基纳，在上海决赛击败霍达尔。谢尔顿连续第二年，拿到都灵门票。"
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_17.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "6ca978e38d298dd61f3f4ca9309f340400fcde78033b9b4f00ce10080b6f1a21",
      "words_sha256": "e3727a7b191fcc2382255ec3b99c87770f82f021a414db688d19b1362b11d527",
      "request_id": "df9f5d51dfb4ba71579be049c1ae30732803a312c4262ed88fda48788786bf1e",
      "request_text": "资格到手以后，巴塞尔止步第二轮。巴黎先胜保罗，再逆转范阿舍，打进决赛。"
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_18.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "404d2fd7b0052a27250356668243bfa49264febe57e2c78869958a3b2d6cfa9f",
      "words_sha256": "dd106cfcba81e02f9dfc8e53c5858cb2301847a08681cd9e114a095919eacfe0",
      "request_id": "854bd13770b9001286c863ff651282973892bbc120f63b77e3cda2865379d7d4",
      "request_text": "决赛再次遇到阿尔卡拉斯。美网他曾赢下这组对决，这次却两盘告负，收获巴黎亚军。"
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_20.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d720b940efd7c43c917bacc19a4ce361460e3ef608d4705669660f5716cad09a",
      "words_sha256": "6a5b008e86bb88063928f5194939ef863556a514a3a2dff65f5d312a466c9c42",
      "request_id": "321c8843295b5621bee207512ad62d8afcbf263729112e666b0b52681ae6673c",
      "request_text": "截至十一月九日，谢尔顿五千一百七十分，赛季积分榜第四。辛纳已退赛，高亮的是本届年终的八位正选。"
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_21.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "71a4fd2856af8c1e8e614a374b66719a5ef7752b89353b4ac85c256ce60de49f",
      "words_sha256": "36c9d34a9571d0d6095a57ae50e1f7ab2c3e0e99e401a9a96b4a2e268e767a4e",
      "request_id": "be3fea002cc3e1ea250333695e79dad44a0452a2a0de4b06f2e903bf196e7193",
      "request_text": "错过温网赛点，后来站上美网决赛。第二次到都灵，你看好谢尔顿冲进4强吗？"
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_cover.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "ce0f6cff2b5544342bb91310a368007df887287945a02b779966e93a73230519",
      "words_sha256": "1a7cf3b01326bb39a2216789fe201319bd4d9f120a81340d28bfd1930d742692",
      "request_id": "8f9197fadfe5a3c8af33f75ab17ff7c833146e8b748c4e275e23cc298f4a9a42",
      "request_text": "谢尔顿年终路，从温网低谷到美网亚军。"
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_outro.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "5e79e5655e47efc2c0d3cee79eaeb80b9ff840b05900c74b39a6b72a62d8d70e",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。"
    }
  ],
